(text "Series resistors, all 0603: 22R on MCU-driven SPI lines (SCK, MOSI, CS, DC) to soften edges;\n0R on everything else = pads to cut / probe / fit a filter if needed." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 259.08 220.98 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "ea7d744e-9a62-4215-9b16-ea45e097a9c6"))
(text "Outputs on IO4-7/IO15: plain GPIOs, input/floating at reset -> pull-downs on the Outputs / Fault_Logic sheets keep them off.\nNot used: IO3, IO45, IO46 (strapping), IO35-37 (octal PSRAM). IO39-42 used as GPIO: JTAG via USB instead." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 200.66 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "6c547ceb-8ea2-41cf-b98d-2bcbe88a4eea"))
